    "Consider the immense strategic advantages of complete asset detachment in digital media. First, asset detachment eliminates personal burnout: you never have to worry about grooming, lighting, background sets, or camera anxiety. Second, it unlocks infinite horizontal scalability: a solo operator can personally appear in only one or two videos per week, but an operator managing automated production pipelines can effortlessly publish five videos daily across ten disparate channels in completely different niches and languages.",
